    questions: [{"prompt":"Which approach best matches the goal of this lesson (Estimate solutions graphically and check with substitution into both equations.)?","choices":["Guess from memory of the lesson title only.","Skip checks because the first answer looks neat.","Ignore domain restrictions and sign errors.","Apply “Systems by Graphing & Tables” with clear structure and a checked result."],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"College-ready algebra shows structure and verification, not guessing.","order":1},{"prompt":"A line has slope 24 and y-intercept 3. What is y when x = 2?","choices":["51","45","27","48"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"y = 24(2) + 3 = 51.","order":2},{"prompt":"Which vocabulary idea is most central to Unit 1 (Linear Functions & Systems) as used in “Systems by Graphing & Tables”?","choices":["skipping the diagram","slope","intercept","random guessing"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Unit 1 leans on precise use of “slope.”","order":3}],
